---
import ToolPage from '../components/tools/ToolPage.astro';
import CoinFlip from '../components/tools/CoinFlip';
---
<ToolPage current="/coin-flip/" title="Flip a Coin Online: Heads or Tails | Who Goes First?" description="Flip a virtual coin for a fair heads-or-tails decision. Free, instant, with a running tally. Settle who goes first in a two-player game." heading="Flip a coin" lede="Heads or tails? Tap to flip a fair virtual coin.">
  <CoinFlip client:load />
  <Fragment slot="about">
    <h2>How to use it to pick a first player</h2>
    <p>For a two-player game, one player calls heads or tails before the flip. If the call is right, that player chooses who goes first. For three or more players, use the <a href="/methods/coin/">coin reveal in the picker</a>, which flips a coin for everyone at once.</p>
    <h2>Is this coin fair?</h2>
    <p>Each flip is an independent 50/50 draw from your browser’s secure random number generator. The result is decided before the animation starts, so the spin can’t change it. Four heads in a row happens about once in every 16 sets of four flips.</p>
  </Fragment>
</ToolPage>
